  description: 'Sometimes you need to use calculations to process information from
    the environment. Operators are used to combine or modify values during execution.

    

    For
    this simulation, calculate the total value of the ores in this level.

    

    Use
    <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#55FF55>measure()</color></font> on both ores
    and store their sum in a variable named <font="JetBrainsMono SDF">total</font>
    in a single run.'
